---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "How Many Days Do You Need in China? Itinerary by Trip Length";
const description = "Plan the perfect China trip. From a 3-day whirlwind to a 3-week adventure — find the itinerary that fits your timeline.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">🏙️ 城市指南</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        How Many Days Do You Need in China? Itinerary by Trip Length
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">计划一次完美的中国之旅。从3天的旋风到3周的冒险——找到符合你时间表的行程。</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 最后更新日期：2026年6月</span>
        <span>⏱️ 阅读6分钟</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-50 to-indigo-50 border-l-4 border-blue-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-4">⚡ 快速回答</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-blue-800 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>中国至少应该有5到7天的时间。</strong> If you only have 3 days, stick to one city (Beijing or Shanghai). With 7–10 days, you can experience both the classic sights and a second contrasting city. Two weeks unlocks the full diversity — history, nature, food, and modern China all in one trip. Here's how to match your itinerary to your available time.
      </p>
    </div>

    <nav class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">🍵 1.茶馆或艺术工作室邀请函</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-3">
        <li><a href="#3-days" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🕐 3天：一个城市，最大影响</a></li>
        <li><a href="#5-days" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🕐 5天：放慢速度或增加第二个城市</a></li>
        <li><a href="#7-10-days" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🕐 7-10天：经典中国路线</a></li>
        <li><a href="#10-14-days" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🕐 10-14天：深潜</a></li>
        <li><a href="#14-days" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">如果您有三周或更长时间，请添加以下一个或多个目的地：</a></li>
        <li><a href="#which-city" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🏙️ 哪个城市适合你？</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <h2 id="3-days" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">🕐 3天：一个城市，最大影响</h2>
    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">三天很紧，但足以让你爱上中国。选择一个城市，沉浸其中。</p>

    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">选项A：北京</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700">
        <li>第一天：紫禁城+天安门广场+景山公园日落</li>
        <li>第二天：慕田峪长城（半天行程）</li>
        <li>第三天：天坛+胡同+喇嘛庙</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-gray-500">最适合：历史爱好者、首次来亚洲的人</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">方案B：上海</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700">
        <li>第一天：外滩+黄浦江游船+南京路</li>
        <li>第二天：豫园+法租界+新天地</li>
        <li>第三天：上海中心大厦+朱家角水乡</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-gray-500">最适合：现代建筑、美食家、夜生活</p>
    </div>

    <h2 id="5-days" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">🕐 5天：放慢速度或增加第二个城市</h2>
    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">再过五天，你就有喘息的空间了。你可以深入一个城市，也可以快速增加第二站。</p>

    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">选项A：北京慢行（5天）</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700">
        <li>为颐和园和798艺术区增加一天</li>
        <li>上烹饪课或了解茶文化</li>
        <li>承德避暑山庄一日游</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">选项B：经典双人组-北京+西安</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700">
        <li>第1-3天：北京（紫禁城、长城、胡同）</li>
        <li>第四天：西安-兵马俑，穆斯林区美食步行</li>
        <li>第五天：西安-古城墙骑自行车，大雁塔</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-gray-500">最适合：想要两个标志性景点的历史爱好者</p>
    </div>

    <h2 id="7-10-days" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">🕐 7-10天：经典中国路线</h2>
    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">七到十天有三个目的地，是最佳选择。</p>

    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">推荐路线：北京→ 西安→ 上海</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700">
        <li>北京（3天）：紫禁城、长城、胡同</li>
        <li>西安（2天）：兵马俑、城墙、美食街</li>
        <li>上海（3天）：外滩、法租界、朱家角</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">随自然变化：北京→ 成都→ 上海</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700">
        <li>北京（3天）：经典景点</li>
        <li>成都（3天）：熊猫繁育基地、青城山竹林、城市公园茶馆文化</li>
        <li>上海（2天）：外滩，天际线</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <h2 id="10-14-days" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">🕐 10-14天：深潜</h2>
    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">两周的时间让你探索中国的全方位——从古都到未来大都市再到自然奇观。</p>

    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">建议14天路线：北京→ 西安→ 成都→ 上海</h3>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full text-left text-gray-700">
          <thead><tr class="border-b"><th class="py-2 pr-4">城市</th><th class="py-2 pr-4">亮点</th><th class="py-2">Highlights</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b"><td class="py-2 pr-4">1–3</td><td class="py-2 pr-4 font-medium">紫禁城、长城、胡同、颐和园</td><td class="py-2">故宫、长城、胡同、颐和园</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b"><td class="py-2 pr-4">4–5</td><td class="py-2 pr-4 font-medium">兵马俑、城墙、穆斯林美食之旅</td><td class="py-2">兵马俑、城墙、清真美食之旅</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b"><td class="py-2 pr-4">6–8</td><td class="py-2 pr-4 font-medium">熊猫、川菜、青城山、茶馆</td><td class="py-2">大熊猫、四川美食、青城山、茶馆</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b"><td class="py-2 pr-4">9–11</td><td class="py-2 pr-4 font-medium">迪士尼（可选），黄山一日游，深入城市</td><td class="py-2">外滩、法租界、朱家角水乡</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="py-2 pr-4">12–14</td><td class="py-2 pr-4 font-medium">迪士尼（可选），黄山一日游，深入城市</td><td class="py-2">迪士尼（可选）、黄山一日游、深入探索城市</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2 id="14-days" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">如果您有三周或更长时间，请添加以下一个或多个目的地：</h2>
    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">桂林/阳朔</p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-lg text-gray-700 mb-12">
      <li><strong>（3-4天）：漓江游船，骑行穿越稻田</strong> (3–4 days): Li River cruise, cycling through rice paddies</li>
      <li><strong>（3-4天）：粤菜，香港一日游</strong> (3–4 days): Cantonese food, Hong Kong day trip</li>
      <li><strong>（5-7天）：熊猫、九寨沟、峨眉山</strong> (5–7 days): Pandas, Jiuzhaigou, Mount Emei</li>
      <li><strong>（6-10天）：昆明、大理、丽江、香格里拉</strong> (6–10 days): Kunming, Dali, Lijiang, Shangri-La</li>
      <li><strong>（2天）：天际线，徒步旅行</strong> (2 days): Skyline, hiking</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="which-city" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">🏙️ 哪个城市适合你？</h2>
    <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-12">
      <table class="w-full text-left text-gray-700 border rounded-xl">
        <thead><tr class="bg-gray-50 border-b"><th class="p-3 font-bold">你是。..</th><th class="p-3 font-bold">历史爱好者</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr class="border-b"><td class="p-3">北京还是西安-3000年的中国历史</td><td class="p-3">吃货</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b"><td class="p-3">成都或广州——中国两大美食之都</td><td class="p-3">现代建筑迷</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b"><td class="p-3">上海或深圳——天际线、装饰艺术、未来主义塔楼</td><td class="p-3">热爱大自然的人</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b"><td class="p-3">将桂林或四川（九寨沟）添加到任何行程中</td><td class="p-3">时间短</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="p-3">一个城市胜过三个城市</td><td class="p-3">📚 相关指南</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="not-prose mt-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">紧急电话号码以及需要帮助时该怎么办</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <a href="/zh/cities/beijing-guide/" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-blue-300 transition">🏛️ <strong>国家移民局-区域免签证政策（海南30天）</strong> — What to see, eat, and do</a>
        <a href="/zh/cities/shanghai-guide/" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-blue-300 transition">🌆 <strong>--对外国人最友好的城市</strong> — The most foreigner-friendly city</a>
        <a href="/zh/cities/guangzhou-guide/" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-blue-300 transition">🥟 <strong>--中国食品之都</strong> — Food capital of China</a>
        <a href="/zh/cities/shenzhen-guide/" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-blue-300 transition">🤖 <strong>-香港旁边的科技中心</strong> — Tech hub next to Hong Kong</a>
        <a href="/zh/cities/chengdu-guide/" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-blue-300 transition">🐼 <strong>--熊猫、辛辣食物和慢生活</strong> — Pandas, spicy food & slow life</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>